Package: radxa-penta-top-hat-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Vathivis <vojtahumpl@seznam.cz>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~), systemd-sysv
Recommends: smartmontools
Provides: rockpi-penta
Conflicts: rockpi-penta
Replaces: rockpi-penta
Homepage: https://github.com/Vathivis/radxa-penta-top-hat-rs
Description: low-memory Radxa Penta SATA HAT top-board daemon
 Controls the optional OLED display, fan, and button on the Radxa Penta
 SATA HAT top board. This Rust implementation uses native Linux GPIO, I2C,
 PWM, and thermal interfaces and runs as a systemd service.
